        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="AA_OcularJelly"]/description</xpath>
          <value><description>A drifting, gas-filled shape that hangs at canopy height, watching the cloud below. It breathes out a faint reddish haze that turns whatever plant it touches into something that shares its own strange flesh. When a zhool sinks low and settles, the valley's old hands know a Burn is coming.</description></value>
        </li>
